# Firebase service-account JSON and local credential files (F-005). The path is an
# env value; these patterns catch the names Google's console downloads under so a
# credential cannot be committed by accident.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
firebase-credentials.json
storage/app/private/firebase/

